DATA LICENSES

The MIT License above covers the source code (src/, scripts/) and the
documentation written by the GrammarLens team. It does NOT cover the data.
The data in this repository is licensed as follows:

1. data/raw/UD_English-EWT/
   Universal Dependencies English Web Treebank (UD English-EWT),
   https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT, commit 4a4d77f.
   License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
   (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
   The full license text is in data/raw/UD_English-EWT/LICENSE.txt.
   Files are unmodified (verified by data/raw/checksums.txt).
   Citation: Silveira et al. (2014), "A Gold Standard Dependency Corpus for
   English", LREC 2014.

2. data/processed/ (GrammarLens-EWT)
   Derived from UD English-EWT by scripts/build_dataset.py. Changes: sentences
   were filtered by cleaning rules, single grammatical errors were injected,
   classes were balanced, and the files were converted to CSV
   (see docs/preprocessing.md).
   As required by the ShareAlike term of the source, this derived dataset is
   released under CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
   The same applies to files in results/ that quote sentences from the
   dataset (results/label_audit.csv, results/error_analysis.md).

3. data/raw/blimp/
   14 files of BLiMP: The Benchmark of Linguistic Minimal Pairs for English,
   https://github.com/alexwarstadt/blimp, commit 3e56b06.
   License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Files are unmodified (verified by data/raw/checksums.txt).
   Citation: Warstadt et al. (2020), "BLiMP: The Benchmark of Linguistic
   Minimal Pairs for English", TACL 8.
